# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local — it is gitignored.

# Canonical site origin, no trailing slash (used for metadata, sitemap, JSON-LD).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Supabase. Both come from Dashboard > Project Settings > API.
# The publishable (anon) key is safe to expose: the leads table is
# insert-only for that role, so it cannot read anything back out.
# There is deliberately no service-role key here — nothing needs one.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Lead notification email, sent over SMTP with nodemailer.
#
# Optional as a group: leave these blank and submissions still save to
# Supabase, they just don't get emailed — the server logs a warning saying
# so. It's deliberately all-or-nothing, so a half-filled config can't produce
# an auth failure on every single submission.
#
# NONE of these may take a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix. That would publish the SMTP
# password to every visitor's browser, handing out the ability to send mail
# as this domain.
#
# SMTP_HOST      your mail provider's outgoing server, e.g. smtp.zoho.eu,
#                smtp.fastmail.com, email-smtp.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com
# SMTP_PORT      587 for STARTTLS (usual) or 465 for implicit TLS. Port 465
#                is treated as secure automatically; anything else is
#                required to upgrade via STARTTLS before authenticating.
# SMTP_USER      the mailbox or SMTP username, usually the full address
# SMTP_PASSWORD  the mailbox password, or an app-specific password if your
#                provider issues them (most do, and it's the better option —
#                it can be revoked without changing your real password)
SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASSWORD=

# LEAD_NOTIFY_FROM the sender shown on the notification. Defaults to
#                  SMTP_USER. Most providers reject a From address that
#                  isn't a mailbox you own, e.g.
#                  "CertLoop <info@certloop.net>"
# LEAD_NOTIFY_TO   where notifications land. Defaults to CONTACT_EMAIL in
#                  src/lib/constants.ts if unset.
LEAD_NOTIFY_FROM=
LEAD_NOTIFY_TO=
